  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc4/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review of today's packages/ self-analysis (57844 nodes): 33391 docstrings, max length 80, 480 exactly 80 chars, 0 with a newline. File nodes now carry docstrings (1617 have one), but each is still the first line cut to 80 chars. Code: ir.py:683 field doc, analyze/base.py:2427 max_len=80, py.py:3389 [:80]. No module-summary field exists. MECHANISM: docstring extraction keeps the first line truncated to 80 chars (extract_doc_comment max_len=80; py.py module docstring split('\\n')[0][:80])."  # e774
